## 📖 Surah 112 (Surah Al-Ikhlas) se Related Hadith

**(Sahih Bukhari & Sahih Muslim – Roman Urdu)**

---

## 1. Surah Ikhlas = 1/3 Qur’an

**Hadith (Roman Urdu):**
Abu Saeed Khudri (RA) se riwayat hai ke Nabi ﷺ ne farmaya:

“Qasam hai us zaat ki jiske haath mein meri jaan hai, **Qul Huwa Allahu Ahad** Qur’an ke ek teesre hissa ke barabar hai.”

**Reference:**
Sahih Bukhari – Hadith 5013
Sahih Muslim – Hadith 811

### Samajh

* Surah Ikhlas Allah ki **tawheed** ko bayan karti hai
* Qur’an ka main message: Tawheed, Risalat, Aakhirat
* Surah Ikhlas **Tawheed** ko mukammal tareeke se batati hai
* Is liye iska sawab **1/3 Qur’an** ke barabar hai

---

## 2. Surah Ikhlas se Allah ki Mohabbat → Jannat

**Hadith (Roman Urdu):**
Ek sahabi har rakat mein **Qul Huwa Allahu Ahad** parhte the. Jab logon ne Nabi ﷺ ko bataya, to aap ﷺ ne farmaya:

“Un se poochho wo aisa kyun karte hain?”
Unhone kaha: “Is liye ke is mein Rahman ki sifat hai aur main is se muhabbat karta hoon.”
Nabi ﷺ ne farmaya: “Unko bata do ke Allah bhi un se muhabbat karta hai.”

**Reference:**
Sahih Bukhari – Hadith 7375
Sahih Muslim – Hadith 813

### Samajh

* Surah Ikhlas Allah ki sifat batati hai
* Jo is se muhabbat karta hai → Allah us se muhabbat karta hai
* Yeh **Jannat ka sabab** banti hai

---

## 3. Surah Ikhlas Protection ke liye (Sone se pehle)

**Hadith (Roman Urdu):**
Hazrat Aisha (RA) farmati hain:

“Nabi ﷺ jab bistar par jate, to apne hathon par phoonk marte, phir **Qul Huwa Allahu Ahad**, **Qul A‘udhu bi Rabbil Falaq**, aur **Qul A‘udhu bi Rabbin Nas** parhte, phir apne jism par haath pherte. Yeh teen martaba karte.”

**Reference:**
Sahih Bukhari – 5017
Sahih Muslim – 2192

### Samajh

* Surah Ikhlas **hifazat** ke liye hai
* Surah Falaq aur Surah Nas ke saath parhi jati hai
* Yeh Sunnah hai **sone se pehle**

---

## 🌿 Surah Ikhlas ka Main Message

* Allah ek hai
* Allah be-niyaz hai
* Na uski koi aulaad
* Na wo kisi ki aulaad
* Koi us jaisa nahi

## ✅ Sunnah Amal

Roz parhein:

* Subah 3 martaba
* Shaam 3 martaba
* Sone se pehle 3 martaba
